#Heliton marcondes prange

### Verbo GET – listar todos
GET http://localhost:8000/funcionario/ HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Verbo GET – listar um
GET http://localhost:8000/funcionario/10 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Verbo POST – adicionar
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/funcionario/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
    "nome": "Helitonteste3",
    "matricula": "153093",
    "cpf": "1233",
    "telefone": "(12) 99999-9999",
    "grupo": 1,
    "senha": "1233"
}


### Verbo PUT – atualiza
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/funcionario/2 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
    "nome": "Beto Silva",
    "matricula": "152099",
    "cpf": "1",
    "telefone": "(11) 99919-9999",
    "grupo": 1,
    "senha": "123"
}

### Login para obter access e refresh tokens
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/auth/login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
"cpf" : "1",
"senha" : "123"
}

